window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Things are looking up for Ofelia Archer and Zach Sully.</p> <p></p> <p>Theyre engaged.</p> <p></p> <p>Ofelias father Oscar is getting the help he needs.</p> <p></p> <p>Now if only the paranormal beings in the French Quarter would start behaving themselves. Thats just not in the cards, though.</p> <p></p> <p>The vampires, voodoo queens, shifters, and witches are ready to wreak havoc. Its up to Ofelia and Sully to keep things under control.</p> <p></p> <p>One way or another.</p> <p></p> <p>This three-book omnibus includes Masters of Hex, Hexcess Baggage, and Taming of the Brew.</p>"; 
